{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_35","type":"agent_message","text":"At `origin/feat/p5b2-lifecycle @ d78028a2`:\n\n1. **CONFIRMED — guest-fatal suppression.** [prelude.cljc:813](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-b2/src/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc:813) sets status 255 and freezes existing finalizable objects before shutdown. Independent probe produced **`BS`**, no destructor output, status **255**.\n\n2. **DEFECT — stream P2 partially fixed.** Runtime response/diagnostic emission and append-only header replacement work. However, [portable_harness.cljc:157](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-b2/test/yang/php/antlr/portable_harness.cljc:157) still converts the request into UAST, after consuming it before execution at [line 246](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-b2/test/yang/php/antlr/portable_harness.cljc:246). The probe found the entire request in a `:literal` operand. Moving conversion into the harness leaves the runtime-input defect open.\n\n3. **DEFECT — cookie validation remains conditional on headers-sent.** The zero getter, error texts and coercions are implemented. But [prelude.cljc:727](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-b2/src/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc:727) refuses headers before validating cookies. After `echo`, excess arguments and an unknown option both produced only a warning and skipped their expected exceptions. [PHP 8.3 validates these before emitting headers](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/php/php-src/PHP-8.3/ext/standard/head.c).\n\n4. **DEFECT — oracle fatal diagnostic still missing.** Single-slot fatal parsing and fold preservation are fixed. But [oracle.clj:139](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-b2/src/dev/yang/php/oracle.clj:139) removes the fatal without adding its diagnostic. Probe result: `:fatal \"boom\"`, `:uncaught nil`, **`:diag []`**; the maintained fixture expects `[[256 \"boom\"]]`, so its comparison fails.\n\nSeat gate: reported **8 tests / 188 assertions / 0 failures**. My duplicate run was stopped without a final tally; targeted probes completed. No files changed.\n\n**Landing authority — `feat/p5b2-lifecycle @ d78028a2`: WITHHELD pending the remaining defects and completed oracle acceptance.**"}}
